# Panel sample artifacts (regenerated by running .jou samples)
# ============================================================================
# Tracked: src/radia/panels/samples/*.jou (canonical .jou recipes)
#          src/radia/panels/samples/*.vol  (export-generated input mesh)
#          src/radia/panels/samples/*.step (CAD input geometry)
